# Game values for TAS scripts (include castaway.tas). Offsets are hex; the names come from
# the game's ELF symbols (docs/tas.md).
#
# The selected Sim (a cXPerson): EGlobal::GetSelectedPerson reads EGlobal+0x174 (pEORGlobals);
# cXObject::GetLocation is the FTilePt at +0xC0: two fixed-point tile coordinates.
alias sim [pEORGlobals__5Globs]+0x174
alias simx [sim]+0xC0
alias simy [sim]+0xC4
# cXPerson::IsSleeping: the float at +0x1A8 is below -30 (-40 while asleep, 0 awake)
alias simsleep [sim]+0x1A8
# The simulator's globals (s16 each, cSimulator::GetGlobal(n) reads +0x32 + 2n): 0 the hour,
# 1 the day, 5 the minute (MODTarget::GetTimeOfDayDisplayValue).
alias hour [pSimulator__5Globs]+0x32
alias day [pSimulator__5Globs]+0x34
alias minute [pSimulator__5Globs]+0x3C

watch x s32 simx
watch y s32 simy
watch day s16 day
watch hour s16 hour
watch minute s16 minute
watch sleep f32 simsleep
